msgstr "立直中に7を%{num}連続で捨てたため、跳満手で和了"

msgid "with hand"
msgstr "手牌"

msgid "with mods"
msgstr "モッド付き"

msgid "with yaku:"
msgstr "役:"

msgid "won with a closed hand, and will flip tiles on the wall from the dora indicator onward, scoring shuugi for every matching tile in hand"
msgstr "門前で和了し、ドラ表示牌から壁の牌をめくり、手牌の一致する牌ごとに祝儀を獲得する"

msgid "won with yakuman, and will flip tiles on the wall from the dora indicator onward, scoring shuugi for every matching tile in hand"
msgstr "役満で和了し、ドラ表示牌から壁の牌をめくり、手牌の一致する牌ごとに祝儀を獲得する"

